  "notes": [
    "**Esconderse** is the reflexive form of **esconder** (to hide something)",
    "Regular **-ER verb** with reflexive pronouns",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **escondido** (regular)",
    "Non-reflexive **esconder**: to hide (something else)",
    "Common usage: *Me escondí detrás del árbol* (I hid behind the tree), *Los niños se esconden* (The children are hiding)",
